---
layout: base
as: raw
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
eleventyImport:
  collections: ["example"]
---

<p>
  Imagine this a an RSS feed,
  looping over articles…
</p>

<hr>

<article
  webc:for="item of collections.example"
  @html="item.content"
></article>

<hr>

<p>
  This works the same
  if we use <code>@raw</code> in the loop,
  and <code>@html</code> in the layout.
</p>
